  sInf {k | ∃ (C : Finset (Finset α)), C ⊆ I.S.toFinset ∧ (⋃ s ∈ C, (s : Set α)) = Set.univ ∧ C.card = k}

/-
There exists a set cover C that achieves the optimal cover size.
-/
